==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|ˈdrɛpa}}

===Etymology===
Old Norse ''[[drepa#Old Norse|drepa]]''

===Verb===
'''drepa''' (+ {{acc}}/+ {{dat}}) ([[drap]] - [[drápu]] - [[drepið]])

# (+ {{acc}}) to [[kill]]
#: ''Ég '''drap''' hestinn.''
#:: I '''killed''' the horse.
# (+ {{dat}}) to [[dip]]
#: ''Að '''drepa''' fingri í lækinn.''
#:: To '''dip''' a finger in the brook.

====Derived terms====
*[[drepa á dyr]] (to [[knock]] at the [[door]])
*[[drepa á]] (+{{acc}}; to [[mention]] something)
*[[drepa á sér]] (of a machine; to [[die]])
*[[drepast]]

